<div class="tab" data-tab="planetside" data-group="main">
    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Enable Planetside</label>
        <input type="checkbox" name="flags.planetside.enabled" {{#if enabled}}checked{{/if}}>
    </div>
    <p class="notes">Render this scene's background image as a 3D globe in space, with stars, atmosphere, and a sun. Saving with this enabled activates the globe view immediately on the current scene.</p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Projection</h3>
    <p class="notes">How the flat map wraps onto the globe. <b>Equirectangular</b> suits most maps (a flat image); <b>Mercator</b> matches a true Mercator-projected map; <b>Equal-area</b> keeps relative sizes. <b>Latitude span</b> sets how far toward the poles the map reaches — 90° covers the whole sphere; less leaves polar caps.</p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Projection</label>
        <select name="flags.planetside.projection">
            {{selectOptions projectionOptions selected=projection}}
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Latitude span (°)</label>
        <input type="number" name="flags.planetside.latitudeSpan" value="{{latitudeSpan}}" min="10" max="90" step="1">
    </div>

    <hr>

    <h3>Terrain (heightmap)</h3>
    <p class="notes">Optional grayscale PNG that displaces the globe into real relief (white = high), baked into the surface so tokens and pings rest on it. Must match the map's framing. Leave empty for a flat globe — nothing is derived. The flat 2D scene is unaffected.</p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Heightmap</label>
        <div class="form-fields">
            <button type="button" class="file-picker" data-type="image" data-target="flags.planetside.heightmap" title="Browse Files" tabindex="-1">
                <i class="fas fa-file-import fa-fw"></i>
            </button>
            <input type="text" name="flags.planetside.heightmap" value="{{heightmap}}" placeholder="path/to/heightmap.png">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Displacement scale</label>
        <input type="number" name="flags.planetside.displacementScale" value="{{displacementScale}}" min="0" max="0.5" step="0.005">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Relief strength</label>
        <input type="number" name="flags.planetside.reliefStrength" value="{{reliefStrength}}" min="0" max="5" step="0.1">
    </div>

    <hr>

    <h3>Title overlay</h3>
    <p class="notes">A title and optional subtitle rendered in a corner of the canvas while Planetside is active. Leave both empty to hide.</p>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Title</label>
        <input type="text" name="flags.planetside.title" value="{{title}}">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Title font</label>
        <select name="flags.planetside.titleFont">
            {{selectOptions fontOptions selected=titleFont}}
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Title size (px)</label>
        <input type="number" name="flags.planetside.titleSize" value="{{titleSize}}" min="8" max="120" step="1">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Subtitle</label>
        <input type="text" name="flags.planetside.subtitle" value="{{subtitle}}">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Subtitle font</label>
        <select name="flags.planetside.subtitleFont">
            {{selectOptions fontOptions selected=subtitleFont}}
        </select>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Subtitle size (px)</label>
        <input type="number" name="flags.planetside.subtitleSize" value="{{subtitleSize}}" min="8" max="120" step="1">
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
        <label>Corner</label>
        <select name="flags.planetside.titleCorner">
            {{selectOptions cornerOptions selected=titleCorner}}
        </select>
    </div>
</div>
